WEBVTT

00:04:28.889 --> 00:04:31.392
and some have had to flee their homes.

00:04:32.476 --> 00:04:35.771
A recent survey shows
that one in three election officials,

00:04:35.813 --> 00:04:37.315
one in three,

00:04:37.315 --> 00:04:39.650
currently feel unsafe doing their work.

00:04:40.693 --> 00:04:42.028
It's appalling.

00:04:42.069 --> 00:04:44.488
And enough is enough.

00:04:45.531 --> 00:04:48.492
We are at a tipping point for US democracy

00:04:48.534 --> 00:04:51.120
and frankly, democracy globally.

00:04:51.537 --> 00:04:52.705
I don't know about you,

00:04:52.705 --> 00:04:54.707
but I personally don't feel comfortable

00:04:54.749 --> 00:04:57.376
just standing around,
leaving things to chance.

00:04:57.835 --> 00:05:02.631
And I especially don't feel comfortable
standing by, asking election officials